  "duration_seconds": 219.452,
  "duration_after_vad_seconds": 208.992,
  "cue_count": 43,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 1.1,
      "end": 7.6,
      "text": "Trust in America, in institutions, and each other is essential to the functioning of U.S. democracy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.213848,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.094543
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 7.6,
      "end": 9.6,
      "text": "Yet today, trust is declining.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.213848,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.094543
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 9.6,
      "end": 12.6,
      "text": "So what impact does this have on American society?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.213848,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.094543
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 12.6,
      "end": 20.6,
      "text": "In this episode, Ruthie Gielnik and Rakesh Koucher help explain trust in the U.S. economic system and views of income inequality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.213848,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.094543
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 20.6,
      "end": 23.6,
      "text": "Economic inequality is kind of a complex topic.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.213848,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.094543
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 23.6,
      "end": 26.6,
      "text": "How would you define economic inequality?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.213848,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.094543
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 27.1,
      "end": 35.1,
      "text": "One way to think of it is as the gap in resources that are available to America's richer and poorer families",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.148315
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 35.1,
      "end": 39.6,
      "text": "and whether or not they have the same opportunity for moving up the economic ladder.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.148315
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 39.6,
      "end": 45.1,
      "text": "Suppose that I rank U.S. families by their income from highest to lowest.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.148315
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 45.1,
      "end": 50.6,
      "text": "In 2019, the incomes of families who ranked the 10th highest on this list",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.148315
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 50.6,
      "end": 56.1,
      "text": "was 13 times as much as the income of families who ranked the 10th lowest.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.148315
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 56.1,
      "end": 60.6,
      "text": "This ratio has also been rising steadily since about 1980.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000911
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 60.6,
      "end": 64.6,
      "text": "This wealth inequality is much more extreme than income inequality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000911
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 64.6,
      "end": 71.6,
      "text": "And one reason for that is wealth is something you accumulate over time and you pass it on to your descendants.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000911
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 71.6,
      "end": 76.6,
      "text": "The increase in inequality certainly has not gone unnoticed by many Americans.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000911
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 76.6,
      "end": 81.6,
      "text": "When we asked about this, most Americans said that there was too much economic inequality in the country.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000911
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 81.6,
      "end": 86.1,
      "text": "We also had about a quarter of Americans saying there was the right amount of economic inequality in the country.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058091,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005817
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 86.1,
      "end": 92.1,
      "text": "But you know, perhaps not surprising, a majority of Americans said that the economy was helping people who are wealthy",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058091,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005817
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 92.1,
      "end": 95.6,
      "text": "and hurting people who are poor and in the middle class.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058091,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005817
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 95.6,
      "end": 102.1,
      "text": "And we also had roughly half of Americans saying that the economy was hurting themselves and their families.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058091,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005817
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 102.1,
      "end": 107.1,
      "text": "So it sounds like Americans don't think the economy is working for all.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058091,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005817
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 107.6,
      "end": 114.6,
      "text": "About seven in 10 Americans said that they think the economic system is unfair and generally favors powerful special interests.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.067656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 114.6,
      "end": 119.6,
      "text": "And like many things in our lives today, there's a pretty big partisan divide on this question",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.067656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 119.6,
      "end": 124.6,
      "text": "with Republicans being more likely than Democrats to say that the system is generally fair.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.067656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 124.6,
      "end": 130.6,
      "text": "So this level of awareness is interesting because of the factors that contribute to inequality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.067656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 130.6,
      "end": 136.6,
      "text": "People may not be aware of the role played by say globalization or technological change,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.067656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 136.6,
      "end": 140.1,
      "text": "but there are some ground level realities they seem aware of.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001699
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 140.1,
      "end": 142.6,
      "text": "For example, do they have good schooling?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001699
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 142.6,
      "end": 144.6,
      "text": "What is the state of crime in their neighborhood?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001699
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 144.6,
      "end": 146.1,
      "text": "Access to health care.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001699
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 146.1,
      "end": 151.1,
      "text": "All these things affect economic mobility and so does discrimination in the labor market.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001699
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 151.1,
      "end": 156.1,
      "text": "And government policies also matter, especially policies that redistribute resources",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001699
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 156.1,
      "end": 161.1,
      "text": "from those at the top of the income ladder to those at the bottom of the income ladder.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001699
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 161.1,
      "end": 164.6,
      "text": "We asked Americans who say there's too much economic inequality,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.071146,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 164.6,
      "end": 168.6,
      "text": "how much responsibility different groups should have in reducing economic inequality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.071146,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 168.6,
      "end": 174.6,
      "text": "And most people said the federal government and big businesses and corporations should have a lot of responsibility.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.071146,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 174.6,
      "end": 181.1,
      "text": "Yes, most of that group says the federal government should have a lot of responsibility in reducing economic inequality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.071146,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 181.1,
      "end": 184.1,
      "text": "But we also know that trust in the federal government is low.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.071146,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 184.1,
      "end": 191.6,
      "text": "We know that Americans are also very divided when it comes to policies that they think would reduce economic inequality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.062157,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001187
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 191.6,
      "end": 195.6,
      "text": "And with sort of wide and growing polarization in this country,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.062157,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001187
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 195.6,
      "end": 201.1,
      "text": "Americans disagree about what the problems are and they disagree about how to solve those problems.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.062157,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001187
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 201.1,
      "end": 204.1,
      "text": "So while there is high distrust in the federal government,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.062157,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001187
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 204.1,
      "end": 209.6,
      "text": "there's still an expectation among many Americans that the federal government should help reduce economic inequality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.062157,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001187
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-11-05T02:18:07+0800"
}